- David, do you have a response?

00:55:35.910 --> 00:55:37.390
Would you like just to
give a response to that

00:55:37.390 --> 00:55:39.320
and then if anyone else wants to comment?

00:55:39.320 --> 00:55:40.348
- Yes, a little bit.

00:55:40.348 --> 00:55:43.460
It's unsettling when you
get a fair proportion

00:55:43.460 --> 00:55:45.230
or don't think an election was legitimate.

00:55:45.230 --> 00:55:48.800
It's unsettling, it's happened
rarely in American history.

00:55:48.800 --> 00:55:50.260
It happened last time.

00:55:50.260 --> 00:55:52.670
You probably get more
than 30% after last time

00:55:52.670 --> 00:55:54.790
we'll say the election
outcome was not legitimate

00:55:54.790 --> 00:55:56.220
but we've gone past it.

00:55:56.220 --> 00:55:58.930
I hope now that the fever going down

00:55:58.930 --> 00:56:00.880
that all of us will go away.

00:56:00.880 --> 00:56:02.830
I don't think our comparisons of

00:56:04.988 --> 00:56:06.730
Weimar and is collapsed
make any sense at all.

