00:58:13.340 --> 00:58:16.270
So one thing in Public
Health which I call pilotisis

00:58:16.270 --> 00:58:19.911
is we keep on doing
successful pilots and not,

00:58:19.911 --> 00:58:23.560
it's almost a disease
that we don't scale up

00:58:23.560 --> 00:58:26.290
to national level impact.

00:58:26.290 --> 00:58:31.290
So avoid the temptation of
doing things here and there,

00:58:32.120 --> 00:58:37.120
be ready for a national
level campaign, large scale.

00:58:37.840 --> 00:58:40.130
It should focus on trust.

00:58:40.130 --> 00:58:42.880
It should also engage communities.

00:58:42.880 --> 00:58:45.890
And the first and the
last one is not at odds.

00:58:45.890 --> 00:58:48.210
They are ways to engage
communities at scale

00:58:48.210 --> 00:58:49.580
if you have a template.

00:58:49.580 --> 00:58:52.330
Community organization is done at scale

00:58:52.330 --> 00:58:53.710
for all sorts of things

00:58:54.690 --> 00:58:57.600
and move water mobilization is one example

00:58:57.600 --> 00:58:59.880
but it's not the only example.

00:58:59.880 --> 00:59:02.800
So these should be the goals
and it should be science-based.

00:59:02.800 --> 00:59:06.900
We should be ready for now.

00:59:06.900 --> 00:59:10.330
They should get ready now
for that kind of a campaign.

00:59:10.330 --> 00:59:11.630
But they should decide

