01:00:13.380 --> 01:00:16.900
it's been a reasonable success

01:00:16.900 --> 01:00:20.890
but they need to decide on
that, what happens afterwards?

01:00:20.890 --> 01:00:23.900
How did they mount a national response,

01:00:23.900 --> 01:00:25.660
