01:00:44.300 --> 01:00:47.490
The Association of Immunization
Managers is out there.

01:00:47.490 --> 01:00:50.290
Engagement of companies,

01:00:50.290 --> 01:00:52.550
the Infectious Disease Society of America,

01:00:52.550 --> 01:00:54.350
the American Medical Association.

01:00:54.350 --> 01:00:57.930
All of that, you don't have
to run the shadow government

01:00:57.930 --> 01:00:59.850
for two months but you can get ready

01:00:59.850 --> 01:01:04.580
for these kinds of
things when for January.

