01:02:29.460 --> 01:02:34.460
And so really it's gonna be
administrative policy making

01:02:34.510 --> 01:02:36.560
that's going to be the way forward.

01:02:36.560 --> 01:02:41.300
And even in a situation
where you have a Senate say,

01:02:41.300 --> 01:02:44.840
Georgia doesn't end up attorning

01:02:44.840 --> 01:02:47.240
both of its special
elections for the Democrats,

01:02:48.213 --> 01:02:50.113
but instead the Republicans hold them.

01:02:51.336 --> 01:02:54.000
The Federal Vacancies Reform Act

01:02:54.000 --> 01:02:58.650
allows for a considerable amount
of time after inauguration

01:02:58.650 --> 01:03:01.270
for acting appointees to serve.

01:03:01.270 --> 01:03:03.420
And we've already seen
that the public really

01:03:03.420 --> 01:03:08.420
