If they had had that, was
it peppered across the news?

01:03:17.220 --> 01:03:19.940
You would imagine there
being some type of pushback

01:03:19.940 --> 01:03:23.040
against Trump and there just hasn't been

01:03:24.570 --> 01:03:27.470
