01:03:28.760 --> 01:03:32.003
outside of the really controversial
ones like Chad Wolfson,

01:03:32.003 --> 01:03:36.430
like the newest, a shuffle
at the department of defense.

01:03:36.430 --> 01:03:41.430
But the federal, the
FCRA allows for 300 days

01:03:41.520 --> 01:03:46.520
for an acting appointee to
serve after inauguration

01:03:47.740 --> 01:03:52.000
and then an additional
210 days if Senate nominee

01:03:52.000 --> 01:03:54.500
is submitted and not confirmed.

01:03:54.500 --> 01:03:57.300
And then another 210 days after that.

01:03:57.300 --> 01:03:59.030
So if you're keeping track at home,

01:03:59.030 --> 01:04:01.680
that's nearly 720 days

01:04:01.680 --> 01:04:05.730
