01:04:25.800 --> 01:04:26.930
- Yeah, so very quickly.

01:04:26.930 --> 01:04:29.970
I mean, first of all, David
was my dissertation advisor.

01:04:29.970 --> 01:04:30.803
And I think

01:04:33.030 --> 01:04:34.820
there's the Reagan's rule was

01:04:34.820 --> 01:04:37.330
thou shall not criticize
a fellow Republican.

01:04:37.330 --> 01:04:40.290
Thou shall not criticize
their dissertation advisor

01:04:40.290 --> 01:04:41.513
is pretty high up there.

01:04:42.430 --> 01:04:46.840
But I'll say that I haven't
put my concerns about

01:04:46.840 --> 01:04:49.490
