01:05:58.770 --> 01:06:02.420
But if the agenda is
controlled by Democrats

01:06:02.420 --> 01:06:05.440
because they have the Senate majority

01:06:05.440 --> 01:06:08.760
then there will be the prospect
for bringing these things

01:06:08.760 --> 01:06:11.770
