01:16:22.230 --> 01:16:24.190
But David, do you have a
comment you'd like to make?

01:16:24.190 --> 01:16:25.840
- That was a good question.

01:16:25.840 --> 01:16:28.203
Maybe we're not hitting on transitions.

01:16:29.150 --> 01:16:30.517
It's easy to see why it's there

01:16:30.517 --> 01:16:32.240
and why it should be there.

01:16:32.240 --> 01:16:34.730
There's just a hangover
from the 18th century.

01:16:34.730 --> 01:16:37.160
Rigidly they had a longer transition.

01:16:37.160 --> 01:16:39.750
It was from early November to early March

01:16:39.750 --> 01:16:41.860
and then they collapse it a bit

01:16:41.860 --> 01:16:46.712
but they collapsed two
months delay as a resident.

01:16:46.712 --> 01:16:48.610
Maybe there's no good reason for it.

01:16:48.610 --> 01:16:50.415
Maybe there's something
to do with presidencies.

01:16:50.415 --> 01:16:52.587
But I don't know that,
presidency is general.

01:16:52.587 --> 01:16:54.603
I just don't know.

01:16:54.603 --> 01:16:57.363
- Christina, is there
something you'd like to add?

01:16:58.500 --> 01:17:01.500
- Yeah, I think also a lot of
it in parliamentary systems

01:17:01.500 --> 01:17:03.040
you have shadow governments.

01:17:03.040 --> 01:17:04.230
You have minority governments

01:17:04.230 --> 01:17:07.420
that have their own shadow
ministers that are involved

01:17:07.420 --> 01:17:10.210
in the process of
administrating the government.

01:17:10.210 --> 01:17:13.130
Whereas in our system, we don't have that.

01:17:13.130 --> 01:17:18.130
We don't have a democratic
or Republic opposite party

01:17:18.250 --> 01:17:19.410
secretary of state

01:17:19.410 --> 01:17:22.700
or an opposite party,
secretary of transportation.

01:17:22.700 --> 01:17:26.997
And so the transitions actually start well

01:17:27.860 --> 01:17:28.787
before the election.

01:17:28.787 --> 01:17:32.660
The transition start is weekly mandated

01:17:32.660 --> 01:17:34.450
to start six months before the election

01:17:34.450 --> 01:17:38.950
and that's when the
individuals who are currently

01:17:38.950 --> 01:17:42.690
in the administration they get together.

01:17:42.690 --> 01:17:45.370
They find their leaders
within each department

01:17:45.370 --> 01:17:48.500
who would lead the transition
and they create documents.

01:17:48.500 --> 01:17:51.060
They create transition landing manuals

01:17:51.060 --> 01:17:54.210
in order to inform the new administration,

01:17:54.210 --> 01:17:57.940
not only of the status quo
of policies and regulations

01:17:57.940 --> 01:18:01.170
that are still in play
or still being processed

01:18:01.170 --> 01:18:04.260
but also just who people are
and where the positions are.

01:18:04.260 --> 01:18:09.260
There's a plum book as it's
called is a 600 page document

01:18:12.850 --> 01:18:15.040
book that's published every four years

01:18:15.040 --> 01:18:17.620
giving way to the all of the appointments

01:18:17.620 --> 01:18:20.090
that need to be made by
a new administration.

01:18:20.090 --> 01:18:21.910
And because of the way that we've set up

01:18:21.910 --> 01:18:25.300
our federal appointment system,

01:18:25.300 --> 01:18:26.970
the new administration has to come in

01:18:26.970 --> 01:18:28.210
and fill all of those spots.

01:18:28.210 --> 01:18:31.500
And so not only figure
out what spots there are

01:18:31.500 --> 01:18:34.210
and who is filling them but then also

01:18:34.210 --> 01:18:36.180
what kind of world those
people are living in

01:18:36.180 --> 01:18:38.610
and whether or not they even
want those people to leave.

01:18:38.610 --> 01:18:42.560
Oftentimes we have a lot
of holdovers that hang on

01:18:42.560 --> 01:18:46.710
after the transition because
it takes so much time

01:18:46.710 --> 01:18:48.310
to get your feet under you.

01:18:48.310 --> 01:18:49.970
- It looks like one of
those holdovers this year

01:18:49.970 --> 01:18:51.323
will be Donald J. Trump.

01:18:52.840 --> 01:18:53.990
- it's actually an interesting thing.

01:18:53.990 --> 01:18:57.080
I guess because it's not a party system.

01:18:57.080 --> 01:18:59.650
The how would the shadow,

01:18:59.650 --> 01:19:01.440
the shadow cabinet workers,

01:19:01.440 --> 01:19:03.170
because the shadow cabinet

01:19:03.170 --> 01:19:05.320
is associated with a political party.

01:19:05.320 --> 01:19:09.120
We don't know who the
nominee is until the summer.

01:19:09.120 --> 01:19:13.330
They would have to then put
together the shadow cabinet.

01:19:13.330 --> 01:19:15.010
I would imagine unless that's something

01:19:15.010 --> 01:19:16.980
the voters expect and demand,

01:19:16.980 --> 01:19:20.540
people have all sorts of
reasons not to want to

01:19:20.540 --> 01:19:23.420
have to put forth the shadow cabinet

01:19:23.420 --> 01:19:28.010
if unless they were compelled
to by public pressure

01:19:28.010 --> 01:19:31.793
because the folks are then
vulnerable to all of the.

01:19:32.800 --> 01:19:34.720
I remember I worked on
a political campaign

01:19:34.720 --> 01:19:38.740
where people were suggesting
the presidential candidate

01:19:38.740 --> 01:19:40.420
named 10 people who might be

01:19:40.420 --> 01:19:43.960
the possible vice presidential nominees

01:19:43.960 --> 01:19:47.090
and we were petrified that
they would both be ridiculous

01:19:47.090 --> 01:19:51.730
and also open each of those
people up to a withering attack.

01:19:51.730 --> 01:19:53.060
If they were named,

01:19:53.060 --> 01:19:55.910
they would have a target put on their back

01:19:57.410 --> 01:20:00.300
once their name was names were released.

01:20:00.300 --> 01:20:03.612
Okay, let's get a few more questions in.

