01:20:39.719 --> 01:20:41.137
- All of them.

01:20:41.137 --> 01:20:42.730
- All of them, okay.

01:20:42.730 --> 01:20:44.735
You care to elaborate?

01:20:44.735 --> 01:20:46.283
- Certainly.

01:20:47.510 --> 01:20:52.510
Typically, first of all,
there's the line of succession

01:20:52.610 --> 01:20:55.880
is of course important to recognize

01:20:57.079 --> 01:21:01.810
and oftentimes cabinet
positions are confirmed

01:21:01.810 --> 01:21:06.010
