sit in the succession line

01:21:06.010 --> 01:21:08.440
being Secretary of State first.

01:21:08.440 --> 01:21:11.660
But we face as Saad has said,

01:21:11.660 --> 01:21:16.660
we face a world of just epic
proportions of mortality

01:21:16.660 --> 01:21:18.690
and morbidity that needs to
be addressed immediately.

01:21:18.690 --> 01:21:22.440
So really you need a
department of Homeland security

01:21:22.440 --> 01:21:25.180
and you need a department
of health and human services

01:21:25.180 --> 01:21:27.410
on day minus two, right?

01:21:27.410 --> 01:21:30.570
Like you need someone who is facilitating

01:21:30.570 --> 01:21:34.500
and coordinating this
massive scale intervention

01:21:34.500 --> 01:21:38.550
that needs to happen not
only for vaccinations

01:21:38.550 --> 01:21:40.750
but also for the fact that you have

01:21:40.750 --> 01:21:43.940
an entire disinformation
campaign to overcome.

01:21:43.940 --> 01:21:46.690
You need to inform people

01:21:46.690 --> 01:21:50.200
that their hospitals are at max capacity.

01:21:50.200 --> 01:21:52.250
And what that means
for them, the fact that

01:21:52.250 --> 01:21:55.040
just because you aren't experiencing

01:21:55.040 --> 01:21:58.750
or don't believe that COVID
is a thing that happens

01:21:58.750 --> 01:22:00.400
or a thing that will affect you

01:22:00.400 --> 01:22:01.870
doesn't mean you won't at one point

01:22:01.870 --> 01:22:03.730
potentially need to be in a hospital.

01:22:03.730 --> 01:22:06.100
Like we should all stop driving our cars.

01:22:06.100 --> 01:22:09.050
If there's no ICU beds in
case we get in a car accident,

01:22:09.050 --> 01:22:11.710
we should, we should watch
out for all of the individuals

01:22:11.710 --> 01:22:15.220
who have heart conditions
that won't seek healthcare

01:22:15.220 --> 01:22:18.580
because either they can't
because hospitals are full

01:22:18.580 --> 01:22:23.060
or because there are afraid
of the risk of catching COVID.

01:22:23.060 --> 01:22:26.800
And so you have as Saad so nicely Put,

01:22:26.800 --> 01:22:28.800
you have this need for an administration

01:22:28.800 --> 01:22:32.330
