01:24:12.900 --> 01:24:14.890
that's been appearing in the Atlantic

01:24:14.890 --> 01:24:17.263
I think has been excellent
during this crisis.

01:24:19.740 --> 01:24:22.050
Speaking of another long from journalist,

01:24:22.050 --> 01:24:24.280
I would read Jane Mayer's wonderful piece

01:24:24.280 --> 01:24:28.620
