01:24:30.330 --> 01:24:33.170
And books that have really influenced me,

01:24:33.170 --> 01:24:35.550
I've actually told a
number of people this and

01:24:35.550 --> 01:24:39.010
I'm not sucking up to
my senior colleagues.

01:24:39.010 --> 01:24:40.750
Jim Scott's against the grain

01:24:40.750 --> 01:24:43.830
which is really a remarkable book.

01:24:43.830 --> 01:24:45.000
A lot of it is about the way

01:24:45.000 --> 01:24:49.342
pandemics have reshaped societies,
so I recommend it highly.

01:24:49.342 --> 01:24:51.210
- Thank you, Jacob.

01:24:51.210 --> 01:24:52.820
